{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adorable fantasy-style ARPG action looter game. The game mechanics are inspired by and pay homage to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose from a variety of classes, control the protagonist to dodge enemy attacks, consume food to recover or enhance their abilities, and use normal attacks and charged attacks to defeat enemies, thereby obtaining powerful equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment features varying random rarities and numbers of affixes. Don\u2019t forget that you can reforge equipment affixes at the blacksmith! Some equipment even has set bonuses\u2014collect a full set to build your own unique gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute cats and dogs may also be hiding some secrets.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4012470?t=1759543808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/76e1c00474ec5edae3608339556c53bba736aba3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759543808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/c190424cc2f8add99e9b3b017848a58c29793d1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759543808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4012470/c190424cc2f8add99e9b3b017848a58c29793d1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759543808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adorable fantasy-style ARPG action looter game. The game mechanics are inspired by and pay homage to <i>Shining Soul</i>.</p><p c